window.products.push({"id":303103,"name":"BlueHills Ultra Compact Travel Blanket Pillow in Portable Bag Case with Hand Luggage Belt & Backpack Clip Premium Cozy Soft Compact Pack Large Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ONDl4ZySS._AC_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Premium soft microfiber material: This super soft, warm travel blanket with patent pending creative design has a very high level of comfort and can be used while sleeping in a variety of different locations and will keep you warm in many situations – especially during airplane travel. Ultra compact 9 inches X 4.5 inches carrying case with large blanket 70 X 56 inches inside- This blanket comes with a soft water proof minuscule carrying case, allowing it to be taken to many different situations, such as in a car, bus, train, plane, airport, while camping, and allows it to be stored easily at home. This easy Portable Pack comes with an attached hand luggage belt allowing you to easily transport it. Hand luggage belt makes it perfect for airplane trips: Hand Luggage Belt in the case makes it Perfect for Airplane Travel Transportation: this blanket case has an attached soft belt, allowing it to be easily attached to a work bag, a backpack, a suitcase, hand luggage, and many more varieties of luggage’s. Very light weight less than 1lb pack and backpack clip included in the package: With the backpack clip / carabiner, you can clip this blanket pillow to any backpack or to any other luggage - with the soft navy blue travel blanket. Can be used as a throw blanket at home or office: This blanket measure 70“length X 56“width, allowing it to easily fit on your couch as a throw blanket/while watching a movie, while also not taking up too much space to not be easily stored on the couch. Great Gift for any traveler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ONDl4ZySS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueHills","source_asin":"B084R6Z6SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084R6Z6SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084R6Z6SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303104,"name":"Chesapeake Bay Candle Scented Candles, Serenity + Calm (Lavender Thyme) & Peace + Tranquility (Cashmere Jasmine), Medium (2-Pack), 2 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S1QwnJNcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chesapeake Bay Candle mind & body collection Medium glass jar candle is a fragrance filled journey into wellness for the mind & body. Sleep and Calm create a serene environment thanks to the calming and balancing benefits of lavender. Enhanced with Essential oils of Bergamot, rosemary, thyme and eucalyptus, this fragrance diffuses a fresh scent along with touches of orange Blossom, allowing you to relax your body and quiet your mind. Includes Essential oils of: rosemary, eucalyptus, camphor, lavender, lavandin, cedar wood, fir needle, fir balsam, orange, patchouli, Bergamot, thyme. Peace and tranquility fresh clean and airy notes of lily of the Valley and Bergamot do not betray the relaxing nature of this fragrant aroma. Escape into the comforting arms of exotic Jasmine, cotton Blossom and rose as they soften the atmosphere. This peaceful floral combination pleasantly rests of delicate cashmere woods, white musk and sandalwood. Includes Essential oils of: Yang, lemon, cedar wood. When finding time has become a luxury, one needs to Pause and look inward to redefine inner Peace and inspire others. Allow moments of Stillness and the simple pleasures of fragrance to take you on a journey for the mind and body. Just as ripples expand across the water of a pond, our flow of emotions fluctuates from core energy to absolute Stillness. Let Chesapeake Bay Candle take you on a sensory journey. . .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S1QwnJNcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chesapeake Bay Candle","source_asin":"B0BZ9NWKF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ9NWKF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ9NWKF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
