window.products.push({"id":303117,"name":"MICHELANGELO Dutch Oven Cast Iron, 5 Quart Dutch Oven Pot With Lid, Cast Iron Dutch Oven, Enameled Dutch Oven With Silicone Handles & Mat, Dutch Oven ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CtOiHGLJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Must-Have 5QT Enamel Dutch Oven: From heat retention and even cooking, to a porcelain-enamel exterior finish for elegant kitchen-to-table serving, and sturdy side handles for easy manageability. This thick-walled dutch oven 5qt with tight-fitting lid is an essential item for every cook thanks to its durability and versatility. Wide Array of One-Pot Recipes: This elegant 5 quart enameled cast iron dutch oven can be used to bake, roast, braise, and sauté. Pizza, French fries, scrambled eggs, and homemade bread are just a few of the delightful things you can make in this Dutch Oven, also as well as to marinate and refrigerate food. Three Safe Designs: 1.Two Wide Loop Handles provide a comfortable grip and easy transporting.2.Stainless Steel Knob, which is safe at any oven temperature.3.Two Sides Beige Enamel,the smooth glass surface won't react to ingredients.Super easy to clean, recommended handwashing. Come with 3 pot protectors that protect your enamel dutch oven pot from chipping and prohibit moisture build up when storing. Suitable All Stovetop:This enameled cast iron dutch oven is suitable for ceramic, electric, gas, grill,and induction cooking tops. Oven safe 500℉. Non Toxic & Eco-Material: Michelangelo 4Qt Enameled Cast Iron Dutch Oven is a kind of innovation that mold made out of natural sand, clay, or a combination of the two holds the melted metal and allows it to form its shape. And it adopts a 100% PFOA, PTFE, lead and cadmium free enamel coating with cast iron eco-material. Package includes: 1 x 5 quart enameled cast iron dutch oven with lid red","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CtOiHGLJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICHELANGELO","source_asin":"B0995Y63D7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995Y63D7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995Y63D7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303118,"name":"G2S Professional Bartender Kit and Cocktail Shaker Set with Stand - 17 Piece Stainless Steel Home Bar Accessories with Modern Bamboo Stand for Mixolog","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bxwf57CFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹The Most Complete Mixology Set -The G2S professional bartender tool kit has been uniquely curated for you to make nearly every drink in the recipe books. The 17 piece set includes all the classic bartending accessories, plus a jigger with 1 and 2 ounce measures instead of the typical .5 an 1 ounce, and a proprietary citrus reamer. Go ahead, get classy! 🍹Pro Cocktail Set & Non-Tipsy Stand-Every part of this 17 piece professional bartender set has been designed with convenience and quality in mind. From the citrus tools for juicing and zesting, the cocktail strainer with extra tight coils for trapping small ice chips, to the classic red bamboo stand that keeps your bartender accessories in place so that muddler and bar spoon won’t fall over between mojito mixing sessions 🍹Heavy Duty Meets Classic Precision-Crafted with 304 stainless steel, the cocktail shaker is extra thick, corrosion-proof, and has laser-precision seal points. All stainless pieces are dishwasher safe. This bartender mixing set is completely hassle-free with a no-risk 30-day money-back guarantee so you can enjoy classic cocktails for years to come 🍹Keep the Fun Flowing-With everything you need to mix everyone's favorite drinks, this portable red bartender kit looks great in your kitchen, can easily be taken with you on holiday, or the red cocktail shaker set can be used out by the fire pit to mix drinks all night long. Red Bartender tools to craft the perfect martini, margarita, whiskey sour and more 🍹The Gift that Keeps Giving-From home or vacation rental parties to all-nighters at the beach, give the gift that everyone appreciates. Ideal as a wedding gift, Christmas gift, birthday gift, Father's Day gift, Housewarming gift, or bosses gift. The G2S cocktail tool kit truly brings creativity and fun every time it is used","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bxwf57CFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G2S","source_asin":"B08C3QR995","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C3QR995","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C3QR995","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
