window.products.push({"id":303149,"name":"Croscill Fabric Shower Curtain Liner, 70 72-inch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E4WP0SZWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Croscill's Fabric Shower Curtain Liners are 100% Polyester and water repellent. Use the tone on tone stripe curtain alone or as a protective liner for your decorative shower curtain. The curtain has weighted plastic hem and metal grommets to hang from at the top edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E4WP0SZWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Croscill","source_asin":"B00FMW7ATK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FMW7ATK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FMW7ATK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303150,"name":"ReynosoHomeDecor Beige, Burgundy, Gold, and Green Floral Brocade Decorative Throw Pillow Cover (22\"x22\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WzGGBzO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Beige, Burgundy, Gold, and Green Floral Brocade decorative throw pillow covers will definitely liven up your furniture. They have a convenient hidden zipper on the back and are extremely well made by a small family business located in Manhattan. The pillow insert / stuffing pillow is not included. For reference, the 18\"x18\" size is pictured. If you'd like the pillow in a different size, send us an email; we will more than likely be able to accommodate you. They are custom made. If you have any comments, questions, and/or concerns please send us an email before you make a purchase. Thank you for visiting our shop!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WzGGBzO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ReynosoHomeDecor","source_asin":"B00F6JAVHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F6JAVHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F6JAVHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303151,"name":"West Bend 60-Cup Commercial Coffee Urn, Stainless Steel (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413E75WPG4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Designed for buffet tables, offices, churces, break rooms, lounges and cafes. Durable, highly polished stainless steel construction including the basket and stem. Interior water level markings make coffee-making easy. Cup per minute brewing with automatic temperature control to keep coffee hot and ready to serve for hours. Twist to secure cover and heat resistant base and trim for added safety. Ready light indicates end of brewing cycle. Power light glows to indicate urn is on. Amazon.com For high-volume coffee production, it doesn't make sense to run multiple pots through a standard drip-filter coffee maker. It's much more efficient to make one large pot that will serve a multitude. This West Bend coffee maker will produce 60 cups of coffee and keep it warm and tasty, without the \"toasting\" effect that occurs when coffee cooks down in a glass pot on a warming burner. Made of professional-grade stainless steel with stay-cool black handle and feet, the 60-Cup Commercial Coffee Urn is well suited to any type of gathering, whether it's for business or pleasure. Clearly marked volume measurement lines can be read from inside or outside the canister. A dripless toggle faucet is positioned so that almost every last drop will pour out--no waste. In addition to brewing coffee, it can heat water for instant beverages or tea. To reheat cold coffee or other beverages by remove basket and filter, refill canister at least up to the 12-cup mark, and plug the unit in; the green \"ready\" light will come on when it's been reheated. Cleaning the coffee maker is important for consistent coffee quality. Wash basket, stem, and cover in hot soapy water, then rinse and dry completely. Coffee stains can be removed by using a non-abrasive cleanser. Do not wash the parts in dishwasher; it may discolor them. Clean outside of unit with a soft cloth or sponge. Clean the inner heating well by using the metal cleaning tool provided with a scouring pad. The coffee maker measures 12 by 16 inches (including lid and handles). It includes a one-year West Bend warranty against defects and comes with a detailed booklet of instructions and tips. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413E75WPG4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B0000E2HFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000E2HFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000E2HFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303152,"name":"BustleDust 100% Natural Marble Vanity Bathroom Tray/Neat Organizer for Cups, Shampoo Perfume Jewelry (Bianco Carrara White,Glossy Surface, 9.8 x 9.8 x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q75lV3RpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[NOBLE NATURAL MARBLE TRAY] - not cheap plastic, resin or PU, our marble trays use 100% high-quality natural white marble stone. Enhance your quality of life with this bathroom tray. You'll love it. NOTE: The texture of natural marble is unique and the pattern of the tray you bought will be different from the picture. [SECURE NON-SLIP MAKEUP TRAY] - Sturdy and High quality,natural marble trays, each piece of marble is selected, cut, polished, and cleaned, all of which are done manually. with four rubber pads at the bottom, to protect the tabletop and prevent the tray from slipping, Your pet won't knock it down.About the use of tray: Before you use it, you can wash it with water or detergent. [EASY MAINTENANCE]- Simple and elegant design of marble tray, easy to clean, wipe it cleans with water or weak detergent. [MULTI-PURPOSE ORGANIZER] - suitable for all kinds of houses, vanity trays for bathroom, vanity tray, Storage Vanity Tray, Cosmetics Jewelry Tray and Coffee Table Serving Tray, Kitchen Organizer. [SIZE] - The size is 9.84 in x 9.84 in x 1.18 in (Dia x H) and the texture of marble is different due to different materials. The marble tray provides a neat space for daily necessities and stores various bottles and cans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q75lV3RpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BustleDust","source_asin":"B0B2K9K7FD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2K9K7FD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2K9K7FD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
