window.products.push({"id":303194,"name":"JOYHILL Tactical Lunch Box for Men Insulated Lunch Bag with Bottle Pouch Holder Large Thermal Cooler Bag for Adult Work Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qzUxSAjYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Excellent Insulation】This cold preservation lunch bag for men is very suitable for outdoor dining. The lunch cooler bag is made of four layers of high-quality insulation material to provide excellent cold / warm preservation up to 6 hours, even effect up to 8 hours with the assistance of ice pack or Insulation box. Perfect for carrying food for work or long periods outdoor activities. 【Suitable Capacity & Multi-Function】JOYHILL adult lunch box sized in 8.5\" x 8.3\" x 11\" (L*W*H), 13L capacity, easy to access with a wide opening. Spacious to accommodate 3 large size lunch containers, 6 cans of drinks and some fruits. 3 side multi-function pockets for tissue, cutlery, snacks phones or other small items. A special designed detachable water bottle pouch adds your convenience for drinking outdoor. Various colors to choose for outdoor work, camping, picnic, beach and more. 【Durable and 100% Leak-Proof】This soft cooler bag has been upgraded with fabrics and accessories. The outer wear / water resistant Oxford fabric is very durable. Customized YKK zipper is smooth to open and close. Both shoulder strap and handle are double stitched with a load-bearing of 44BL. 100% leakproof aluminum foil lining and the heat-pressed seams to guard against leaks. 【Excellent Design】This insulated cooler bag is designed with a mixture of outdoor and tactical elements, very tough. This lunch box can be messenger bag or a handbag, coming with adjustable shoulder strap and wider shoulder pad for reducing load-bearing. The front pocket has a velcro for affixing national flags or warning tips. Meet requirements of outdoor lovers and military fans for lunch box cooler, add more fun for your lunch. 【Easy to Clean and Maintain】The outer material is dust-proof, water resistant and easy to clean, and the inner lining is customized aluminum foil, you can wipe gently with a paper towel or damp cloth to clean. Do not put this cooler lunch box in the washing machine. When not in use, please put the detachable strap in the bag and store the thermal lunch box in a dry, cool place. We are very concerned about your experience, so feel free to contact us if you have any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qzUxSAjYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYHILL","source_asin":"B087Q6M4ZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087Q6M4ZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087Q6M4ZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
