window.products.push({"id":303316,"name":"Blanche Gifts Black and White Banksy DJ Thinking Monkey Sitting on Toilet Seat Canvas Wall Art Print – Stretched on Wooden Frame and Ready to Hang – S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dL4kwBGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Canvas Print: This Banksy inspired canvas print is an original creation that tries to depict what the DJ ‘Thinker Monkey’ was doing while in his state of profound thought. Similar to humans, some of the greatest ideas from this monkey probably also came while doing mundane tasks. What could be more mundane than the daily morning ritual of sitting on a toilet seat? The background shows a simple backdrop of a toilet seat with a print of Banksy’s ‘Girl with Balloon’ artwork which was later shredded and renamed to ‘Love is in the Bin” hanging on the wall. This playful picture would fit well in any room but would be especially appreciated by fans of Banksy who recognizes which of his artworks this canvas pulls from. Use and display: Perfect choice for wall decor for the living room, bedroom, guest room, bathroom, dining room, meeting room, hallway, nurseries, coffee house, condo house, hotels, inn, Spa, Lounge, Sauna and other spaces of home, office, business Perfect Gift Idea: For Wedding, Anniversary, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine, Birthday and others. Unique Picture: This Banksy inspired canvas is an original unique design. Pay attention to the size: This panel size is 11.75 x 15.75 inches. Please note display pictures are only for illustration purposes. Please measure your wall properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dL4kwBGIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blanche Gifts","source_asin":"B08KTG7KB3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KTG7KB3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KTG7KB3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
