window.products.push({"id":303373,"name":"Accessories Kit For Instant Pot: 10 Pieces - Springform Cake Pan/Steamer Basket/Egg Steamer Rack/Silicone Egg Bites Molds/Oven Mitts/Food Tongs/Magnet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616dY1+kHgL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Do you lead a busy life but still wish to eat healthy in a more efficient way? Do you cook up juicy, flavorful food with adding tons of unnecessary extras?Do you have a pressure cooker and need some new accessories?The Creativefine Accessories Kit will provide you with THE BEST SOLUTION TO HEALTHIER COOKING ✓EACH SET CONTAINS: ✓1xSPRINGFORM PAN 1.Durable carbon steel distributes heating evenly;2.Nonstick coating for fast and easy food release;3.Latch handles for quicker and easier cake removal and serving;4.Removable bottom and sides, well suited for baking cheesecakes, tortes, tarte, and more;5.Darker pan absorbs heat and takes shorter to bake;6. 7 inches for serving 2;7.Oven safe up to 450° F; 8.Rolled rim keeps contents from spilling;Note: Liquids may leak out; ✓1x EGG BITES MOLD WITH LID: 1.Made from high-quality silicone;2.1.86 ounce cubes to store chunkier textures, from leftover mac and cheese to cut-up meals;3.See-through clear lid for secure sealing;4.Cook many mini egg omelette bites all at once; ✓1xEGG STEAMER TRIVET STAND: For eggs storage and steaming hard boiled eggs ✓1x STEAMER BASKET: 1.Durable fine mesh stainless steel construction;2.Handle for easier removal from the pot;3.Wide rim for cooking more food at the same time; ✓2x PLATE CLIP CLAMP TONG: 1.Made of stainless steel, two feet clips;2.Used in kitchen and bakery;3.Comfortable to grip and easy to clip plate. ✓1x HEATPROOF OVEN MITTS: Easy-to-clean silicone shell/Textured gripping lines for easy to grip/Keep you safe when handling hot dishes ✓3xCHEAT SHEET MAGNETS: 1.For commonly cooked food including grains, beans, vegetables and a variety of meats.2.Easy reference saves your time.3.Soft flexible magnets for attaching to fridge/ other flat surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616dY1+kHgL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creativefine","source_asin":"B07KTXGT2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KTXGT2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KTXGT2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303374,"name":"Sunhop Bathroom Rugs Bath Mat, 2 Piece Microfiber Green Bath Mat, Non-Slip Soft Thickness Shaggy Water Absorbent Shower Carpet Rug, Machine Washable Q","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nTw-HmAkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Before purchasing, please measure your toilet and compare the dimensions with our products before placing your order. Thickness: 1 Inches 【Green Bathroom Rug Sets】Sunhop bathroom rugs is designed to fit around your commode with a contoured cutout 20 x 20 inch, the U-shaped rug will fit most contoured toilets perfectly. Unique fiber-locking technique, say goodbye to horrible fiber-dropping! Thicker and better constructed than most other rugs. and the other one is a versatile rectangle 32x20 inch carpets perfect for bathroom, vanity, hotel, vacation home, bedroom, living room, pet rug and so on 【Ultra Absorbent】Our bathroom rugs and mats sets are made of 100% premium quality thick, soft, and absorbent microfiber polyester. Our mat provides a soft and comfortable barrier against cold and hard floors and offers more activity space. Water will not seep through the rug to the floor underneath. Help keep the floor dry and clean. Provide you a comfortable place to stand 【Bathroom Rugs Non Slip & Safety】We use the more expensive TPR backing (not PVC or glue) which is much stronger and durable for long lasting use, unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after a number of washes. (NOTE: Do not place mat on wet surface. Make sure floors are dry underneath the rug to prevent the rug from slipping.) 【Easy To Clean】Wash on cold with mild detergent. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed, hang to dry, or air dry flat. Do not Bleach or Dry Clean. After 10 times machine wash tests, our bathroom rugs still look as good as the new ones. No worry about it getting the fibers off, it's really easy to handle and care for. Sunhop bathroom rug toilet set is your best choice! 【Satisfaction Guarantee】If you are not satisfied with any of our bathroom rugs, please contact our customer service and we will be happy to provide you with the choice of a replacement or refund. We stand by our products 100% and want our customers to love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nTw-HmAkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunhop","source_asin":"B09C7Z2TZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C7Z2TZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C7Z2TZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
