window.products.push({"id":303694,"name":"LIANTRAL Coffee Mug Holder, Set of 4 Rustic Wall Mounted Cup Hanging Rack Organizer with 16 Hanger Hooks for Home Decor, Coffee Nook (Gray-Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717y4MPCovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Install type: wall mounting. PREMIUM MATERIAL: Made of solid paulownia wood, features lightweight function, design in minimalist & rustic style, the coffee mug organizer would be a great addition to any wall space, suitable for cafe, tearoom, kitchen, sitting room, or backyard. WALL MOUNT MUG HANGER: the LIANTRAL coffee cup organizer includes 4 racks totally with 16 display hooks, each rack consists of 4 hooks that hold anything up to 8 lbs, the space is approximately 4.65-in between 2 mug hangers which can avoid collision damage. VERSATILE WALL RACK: this set of 4 wall racks is not only used as a coffee mug holder, teacup organizer, it also can be used in the bathroom or entryway as a towel rack, coat rack. What's more, these 4 racks can flexibly group together or hang separately to accommodate the wall. EASY TO INSTALL: the wall rack comes with the screws, anchors, and installation manual, customers need to set these racks on the wall to keep the mugs, towels, or clothes organized, with a stylish look that fits most decor. CUSTOMER FIRST: We offer premium quality and the best service. No matter what reason causes dissatisfaction, please reach out to us and we will be glad to assist you with the issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717y4MPCovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIANTRAL","source_asin":"B0972RFS1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972RFS1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972RFS1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303695,"name":"DANGTOP Cooling Blankets, Bamboo Blanket for All-Season, Cooling Blankets Absorbs Body Heat to Keep Cool on Warm Night, Ultra-Cool Lightweight Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cohg6oh3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Cooling】: Dangtop cooling blankets are made of bamboo material, the fiber structure is porous, multi-slit, and hollow, so it's 3-5 times better than cotton in moisture absorption and breathability. Ideal for hot sleepers whose suffering from hot flashes and night sweats, you will feel much cooler than using other cotton or poly blankets. The fabric is lightweight and silky, won't stick to the skin, or feel stuffy, keeps you cooler all summer and more comfortable sleep on hot nights. 【Keep sweat free all seasons】: This bamboo blanket can regulate body temperature and moisture-wicking, speed up circulate airflow, bring your temperature down, so your skin can keep dry and cool without night sweats, and help you away from sticky feelings whether it's summer or winter. Cooling-touch fabric features high specific heat capacity, which means this cool blanket has stronger heat absorption and heat dissipation capacity than normal fibers, so it will bring a cool night's sleep. 【Cool & breathable experience】: Sleep with a cool temperature can fall asleep faster and get a high quality sleep. This blanket is skin-friendly, It is better to use this cooling blanket next to the skin, so your skin could feel cool soon. Cooling bamboo blanket has a better cooling effect when used with fans or air conditioners, which can quickly reduce the body temperature by about 2-4 degrees, even one degree makes a big difference when sleeping. 【Easy wash and care】: Machine wash on a delicate cycle (A laundry bag comes with the blanket. We recommend you put the blanket into laundry bag when cleaning it to reduce the damage to the fiber and protect the blanket.); Dried in the dryer on air dry or no heat cycle, while we still recommend hang it on the clothes hanger vertical and dry it in a cool ventilated place. Note: don't dry the bamboo blanket in the sun; don't bleach or dry clean, or the service life of the bamboo fiber blanket will be shortened. 【Best gift and multiple uses 】: This summer cooling blanket can be used as an air conditioner blanket, nap blanket, travel blanket, car blanket, sofa blanket and anywhere you want a comfy blanket to keep cool; This cold blanket is also perfect as a birthday gift, holiday gift, anniversary gift, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Valentine's Day. 【High quality products and services】: We focus on researching cozy and aesthetic throw blankets, and insist on weaving our blankets with the best yarn, the most appropriate textile technology, and the most thoughtful design to provide our customers with high-quality products and after-sales services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Cohg6oh3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DANGTOP","source_asin":"B0B7XYPT5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7XYPT5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7XYPT5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
