window.products.push({"id":303708,"name":"Food Sealer - Automatic Vacuum with Non-Vacuum Seal Optio - LED Indicator – Preserve Dry & Moist Foods Fresh up to 3 Months – Lightweight - Fits up 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715uDXWfxaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOU'VE BEEN DOING IT WRONG FOR YEARS The perfect way to deal with your food! Are you one of those people who would throw their fresh food into the freezer carelessly? Don't worry, because  most of us are guilty of the exact same thing. One way a million times better for everyone with a kitchen is to use vacuum sealers for food. They have the ability to lock in all the juicy flavors and freshness for months at a time,  plus they even protect the food from things that could easily harm your health. You need a great frozen food sealer! You likely have dozens of different kitchen accessories, so your food sealer must be small and light enough to store  away easily. It must also work so well it won't let anything in or out once your bags have been sealed shut, plus it  should be delicate enough to protect your food during the packing process. Once you finally have your food sealer  you'll want to try it out straight away, and because it deals with bags up to 12-inches wide it will handle anything you throw at it. Are you finally ready to transform your kitchen with a food sealer that: - Will save you so much money because you'll throw out much less food. - Can be used for different kinds of cooking if you want to become a master chef. - Is so easy to operate you can do it using one single touch. - Has a bright light to indicate to you when all is good to go. - Gives you complete control of the process through a variety of different options. Anyone who enjoys cooking will never be able to create the tastiest meals ever without a food vacuum sealer. Click 'Add to Cart' now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715uDXWfxaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wollin","source_asin":"B01MT7E6VH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT7E6VH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT7E6VH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
