window.products.push({"id":303820,"name":"Brewer's Best - 1009 - Home Brew Beer Ingredient Kit (5 Gallon), (Gluten Free Ale) Straw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zB9oyrSYL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ale is the perfect choice for those looking for a gluten free beer. The wort is crafted from white sorghum and Belgian style syrup and then complemented with an addition of orange and lemon peel. Lightly bitter with undertones of floral and Citrus from the hops, this ale is smooth and refreshing. At last, a gluten free ingredient Kit that can be enjoyed by all!, brewer's best gluten free ale, crafted from white sorghum and Belgian style syrup, lightly bitter with undertones of floral and Citrus, country of origin - United States, manufacturer name - Home Brew Ohio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zB9oyrSYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brewer's Best","source_asin":"B00B6CMF40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B6CMF40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B6CMF40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
