window.products.push({"id":303922,"name":"Yoshihiro 46 Layers Hammered Damascus Gyuto Chef Knife and Petty Utility Knife SET (Gyuto 8.25'' (210mm) & Petty 6'' (150mm), Rosewood Handle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":324.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-dCZbrk5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Knife Features → Blade Material: VG-10 Stainless Steel  →Edge Angle: Double Edged  →Grade: Damascus  →Handle Shape: Octagonal  →Handle Material: Rosewood  →HRC:60  →Knife Style: Gyuto, Petty  → Set: 2pc  →Saya Cover: Natural Magnolia Wood  →Stain Resistant:Yes  Forged and hammered with 46 layers of steel in the Damascus tradition with a VG-10 Core, the VG-10 Hammered Damascus Series has been a perennial best seller, combining performance, beauty, and extraordinary value.The most versatile and essential of all knives a cook can have is a Japanese chefs knife known as a Gyuto knife. The Gyuto is a Japanese chefs knife with a curved blade that smoothly rocks back and forth and has an extended tip for quick chopping that can be used to cut meat, fish, and vegetables. Sometimes called a utility knife, the Petty is a smaller version of a chefs knife but is bigger than a Paring knife. The Petty fits in small places that require more dexterity than bigger chefs knives while handling bigger jobs than a Paring knife can take care of. The Petty will soon become the go to knife in your kitchen.These knives are complimented with a traditional Japanese Wa-style handcrafted Octagonal Handle that is lightweight and ergonomically welds to the hand for seamless use. A protective wooden sheath called a Saya is included, which protects the knife and adds to its appearance when not in use. The hammered texture of the blade eliminates friction and keeps food from sticking to the blade. Traditional Japanese knife making values a sharp edge, which requires attention and care. Sharpening and honing should be done with only water whetstones. Hand wash and dry only, and do so immediately if working with acidic ingredients. Do not use on objects such as bones, nutshells, and frozen foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-dCZbrk5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoshihiro","source_asin":"B07F97F4D5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F97F4D5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F97F4D5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303923,"name":"Monkeybrother Kitchen Tools Spice Grinder/garlic Press Machine Mortar and Pestle Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GctJK+aOL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Product Information: Brand: Monkeybrother  Name: Stainless Steel Mortar & Pestle  Material:high quality 201 stainless steel. (dull polished)  Mortar external diameter:Approx.100mm  Mortar inner diameter:Approx.85mm  Mortar height:Approx.92mm  Pestle small diameter:About 25mm  Pestle large diameter:About 35mm  Pestle length:Approx.140mm  The net weight of Mortar:Approx 460g.  The net weight of Pestle:Approx 150g  Package Included: 1x Mortar + 1x Pestle   And other uses about Mortar and Pestle, like Almond, Chinese herbal medicine, sesame, peanut, melon seed, children's food and so on. Monkeybrother Brand We promise we committed to what our customers request, high quality, reasonable price and good service. So should you any questions for our items, we are willing to receiving your E-mails.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GctJK+aOL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monkeybrother","source_asin":"B00LTO37JW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LTO37JW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LTO37JW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":303924,"name":"Sunpentown SPT WA-9040DE Dual-Hose 9,000-BTU Portable Air Conditioner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317MERSBPbL._AC_.jpg","description":"\"This 9,000btu, 3 in 1 system provides multi-season comfort. Designed to efficiently cool, dehumidify any space without permanent installation. Effectively improves air circulation in poorly ventilated spaces. Dual hose systems provide fast cooling with one hose for air intake and the other for air exhaust. Self Evaporating Technology during the cooling or heating process, water is extracted from the air into the unit. In Cool mode, most of this water is recycled and used to cool the cooling coils. This creates improved cooling efficiently without adding energy cost. The moisture is then pushed out with the exhaust air, leaving you a virtually no drain unit. In extreme humid conditions, if condensation collects faster than the unit can evaporate, the excess water will collect in the built in tank. When the tank becomes full, compressor will automatically shut off and unit will indicate that drainage is needed. Exhaust hose installation required and all standard accessories included. Included plastic slider kit forms up to 6.75 ft. Specifications Cooling capacity: 9,000btu / hour Power consumption: 977 W Amperage: 8.5A Air volume (CFM): 176 Moisture removal: 47 pints/day Operating temp: 64 - 110°F Thermostat: 64 - 90°F Control: digital with LCD EER: 9.21 dB (High / Low): 50.1 / 47.8 Power supply: 115V / 60Hz Max room size: 250 sq. ft. Timer: 1 - 24 hours Fan speeds: 3 (Auto - High - Low) Compressor: Rotary Refrigerant / Load: R22 / 1.4 lb Exhaust pipe max length: 5.5 ft. Exhaust pipe diameter: 5.25 in. Window kit material: Plastic slider kit Window kit length: Min: 28.25 in. / Max: 81.5 in. Product dimension (L x D x H): 18 x 18.5 x 33.5 in. Package dimension (L x D x H): 20.5 x 23 x 35 in. Net weight: 82 lbs. Gross weight: 88 lbs.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317MERSBPbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPT","source_asin":"B000OZYD8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000OZYD8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000OZYD8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
