window.products.push({"id":303971,"name":"OXO Good Grips 2 Cup Adjustable Measuring Cup & Good Grips 2-Cup Angled Measuring Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bM0mwEQvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"OXO Good Grips 2 Cup Adjustable Measuring CupOXO Good Grips Adjustable Measuring Cup: Get yourself out of sticky situations with the OXO Good Grips Adjustable Measuring Cup. An internal track and comfortable turning knob allow the plunger in the body of the Measuring Cup to adjust smoothly to the desired measurement marking. Simply fill the cup with your sticky ingredient and turn the knob to push it right into your mixing bowl. The plunger acts as a squeegee on the inside of the Cup, getting out every last bit of your ingredient. The Cup can also be used for wet and dry ingredients, eliminating the need for multiple sizes of measuring cups and spoons scattered throughout your kitchen. The generous rim makes pouring ingredients easy. It’s the Little Things: At OXO, we consistently develop products that address even the tiniest of pet peeves, because we know it’s the little things that make the biggest difference. With many cooking and baking aficionados among us, we know all too well the difficulties that come with measuring sticky foods. The twisting track makes sure the Cup won’t re-adjust while you’re adding ingredients, to ensure you always have the most accurate measurement. Features & Benefits: Adjustable: Cup twists for easy, convenient measurement of various volumes Dispenses sticky ingredients: Smooth, rotating body and comfortable turning knob is perfect for measuring and dispensing peanut butter, honey and other sticky products Accuracy: Internal track easily guides plunger to desired measurement marking Measurement: The Cup has easy-to-read measurement markings for liquid or dry ingredients, in ounces, milliliters and cups Plunger: Silicone disk acts as a squeegee inside of Cup Easy-pour: Generous rim makes pouring wet or dry ingredients easy Capacity: Measuring Cup is available in 2 cup, 1 cup and 1/8 cup sizes Cleaning: Top-rack dishwasher safe BPA Free     Good Tip: With this Cup, you don’t have to dirty multiple measuring cups for one recipe! Usable for dry, solid, liquid and sticky ingredients, this product covers all your measuring needs. You won’t even need to use a spatula to pull out left-over residue, as the design pushes out even the stickiest of ingredients with no waste.     OXO is dedicated to providing innovative consumer products that make everyday living easier. How do we do it? We study people – lefties and righties, male and female, young and old – interacting with products and identify ways to make them better. Our “question everything” process and relentless attention to detail uncover the best solutions for slicing, peeling, whisking, baking, stirring, washing, scrubbing, dusting, storing and organizing.OXO Good Grips 2-Cup Angled Measuring CupSay goodbye to bending to check your liquid measurements. The OXO Good Grips 2-Cup Angled Measuring Cup makes everything from crafting batch cocktails to whipping up soups easier, thanks to our revolutionary design that allows you to read the measurement by simply looking down into the Cup. Our Cup is a favorite with Good Housekeeping magazine editors because the patented angled surface inside lets you easily read cup, ounce and milliliter markings from above. Our lightweight, BPA-free Cup has a non-slip handle and a generous spout that let you pour with comfort and control. Also available in Mini, 1-Cup and 4-Cup versions. Top-rack dishwasher safe.Say goodbye to bending to check your liquid measurements. The OXO Good Grips 2-Cup Angled Measuring Cup makes everything from crafting batch cocktails to whipping up soups easier, thanks to our revolutionary design that allows you to read the measurement by simply looking down into the Cup. Our Cup is a favorite with Good Housekeeping magazine editors because the patented angled surface inside lets you easily read cup, ounce and milliliter markings from above. Our lightweight, BPA-free Cup has a non-slip handle and a generous spout that let you pour with comfort and control. Also available in Mini, 1-Cup and 4-Cup versions. Top-rack dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bM0mwEQvL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B074KGV4KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-303971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074KGV4KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074KGV4KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
